## Runtime posture

Team mode: `{{ orchestration.teamMode }}` (requires `CLAUDE_CODE_EXPERIMENTAL_AGENT_TEAMS=1` and
`--teammate-mode in-process`). Fallback mode: `{{ orchestration.fallbackMode }}` — if the runtime
falls back to subagents instead of an in-process agent team, that fallback must be recorded in
the run evidence. It must never be silently reported as an agent team.

`bypassPermissions` is never used or fallen back to by this orchestration. Worktrees provide
writer-collision isolation only; they are not a security sandbox. Merge, deployment, and
secret operations remain unauthorized regardless of wave outcome.
